{"goal":"理解队头、队尾与先进先出。初始空队列，依次执行 enqueue(3) → enqueue(8) → dequeue() → enqueue(5)，追踪队头、队尾、有效元素和出队值。","materials":{"capacity":3,"facts":{"boundary":"固定容量 3，无扩容或环绕。满队列入队或空队列出队返回 false，队列不变，失败的出队不写 *out。传入指针须有效。演示只展示成功操作完成后的状态。","complexity":"入队 O(1)，成功出队前移 count-1 个元素，时间随原有效元素个数线性增长。","dequeue":"出队先判空，经 *out 写回原队头，将剩余元素向前移动一格，减少 count，返回 true。布尔返回值表示成功与否，旧存储槽是否清零不影响有效元素。","enqueue":"入队先判满，再向 data[count] 写入新值，增加 count，返回 true。","f0":{"dequeued":null,"frame_id":"f0","front":null,"line":24,"operation":"初始化空队列","rear":null,"values":[]},"f1":{"dequeued":null,"frame_id":"f1","front":3,"line":26,"operation":"enqueue(3)","rear":3,"values":[3]},"f2":{"dequeued":null,"frame_id":"f2","front":3,"line":27,"operation":"enqueue(8)","rear":8,"values":[3,8]},"f3":{"dequeued":3,"frame_id":"f3","front":8,"line":28,"operation":"dequeue()","rear":8,"values":[8]},"f4":{"dequeued":null,"frame_id":"f4","front":8,"line":29,"operation":"enqueue(5)","rear":5,"values":[8,5]},"fifo":"先进先出。主例先入 3 后入 8，出队取出 3，8 成为新队头，最后 5 成为队尾。","order":"有效元素位于 data[0..count)，从队头到队尾排列。空队列没有队头、队尾，非空时分别为 data[0] 和 data[count-1]，单元素同时是队头和队尾。"},"main":{"frames":[{"dequeued":null,"frame_id":"f0","front":null,"line":24,"operation":"初始化空队列","rear":null,"values":[]},{"dequeued":null,"frame_id":"f1","front":3,"line":26,"operation":"enqueue(3)","rear":3,"values":[3]},{"dequeued":null,"frame_id":"f2","front":3,"line":27,"operation":"enqueue(8)","rear":8,"values":[3,8]},{"dequeued":3,"frame_id":"f3","front":8,"line":28,"operation":"dequeue()","rear":8,"values":[8]},{"dequeued":null,"frame_id":"f4","front":8,"line":29,"operation":"enqueue(5)","rear":5,"values":[8,5]}],"source":"#include <stdbool.h>
#include <stddef.h>

enum { CAP = 3 };
typedef struct { int data[CAP]; size_t count; } Queue;

static bool enqueue(Queue *q, int value) {
    if (q->count == CAP) return false;
    q->data[q->count] = value;
    ++q->count;
    return true;
}

static bool dequeue(Queue *q, int *out) {
    if (q->count == 0) return false;
    *out = q->data[0];
    for (size_t i = 1; i < q->count; ++i)
        q->data[i - 1] = q->data[i];
    --q->count;
    return true;
}

int main(void) {
    Queue q = {{0}, 0};
    int value;
    if (!enqueue(&q, 3)) return 1;
    if (!enqueue(&q, 8)) return 1;
    if (!dequeue(&q, &value)) return 1;
    if (!enqueue(&q, 5)) return 1;
    return 0;
}
